{"data":{"title":"What's It Gonna Be?! (feat. Janet)","slug":"whats-it-gonna-be-feat-janet","path":"/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/what-s-it-gonna-be-feat-janet/","artwork":"images/artists/busta-rhymes/tracks/what-s-it-gonna-be-feat-janet.jpg","artist":{"id":"C0u7BUAzfQE","slug":"busta-rhymes","links":null,"title":"Busta Rhymes","artwork":null},"id":"oVotnh0Ihlg"},"appearanceCount":7,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"9aGHbCFuPGY","show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"SB2ZbxYEnrE","show":{"id":"fvysxQ51R54","slug":"298","title":"Soulection Radio Show #298 (Live from Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia)","artwork":"/images/episodes/298.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-02-25T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"LQRnrnpTyKw","show":{"id":"Jg9Pdh4kvPA","slug":"317","title":"Soulection Radio Show #317","artwork":"/images/episodes/317.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-07-08T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"rBTjD90b6NE","show":{"id":"gXo3AqS_FMA","slug":"339","title":"Soulection Radio Show #339 (Live from Melbourne, Australia)","artwork":"/images/episodes/339.jp